    P (node13Gen tr₁ b ikA ikBPk spkPk pqPk ⟨0, by decide⟩) ∧ P (node13Gen tr₁ b ikA ikBPk spkPk pqPk ⟨1, by decide⟩) ∧
    P (node13Gen tr₁ b ikA ikBPk spkPk pqPk ⟨2, by decide⟩) ∧ P (node13Gen tr₁ b ikA ikBPk spkPk pqPk ⟨3, by decide⟩) ∧
    P (node13Gen tr₁ b ikA ikBPk spkPk pqPk ⟨4, by decide⟩) ∧ P (node13Gen tr₁ b ikA ikBPk spkPk pqPk ⟨5, by decide⟩) ∧
